    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881090/extras/70c8f339724a896a25c36b3ccf3702b9.poster.avif?t=1725107943\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881090/extras/70c8f339724a896a25c36b3ccf3702b9.webm?t=1725107943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881090/extras/70c8f339724a896a25c36b3ccf3702b9.mp4?t=1725107943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2>Mutant super soldiers have brought humanity to the brink of destruction through a campaign of brutal mutilation and rampant human breeding. It's up to Layla to protect the chastity of her and allies and bring peace back to Earth! <br><br>Collect a wide arsenal of futuristic weapons, then run and gun your way through hordes of enemies <strong>mowing down everything in sight! </strong> Fall pray to the lustious enemies however, and scenes of <strong>torment and pleasure await you... </strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2>The year is 2X45. A man-made race of mutant super soldiers known as &quot;Neo-Humanoids&quot; turn on their creators, and mankind now faces annihilation. Bio-engineered to be ultimate warriors, the combat hardiness and might of these creatures was unmatched. That was until, in humanities darkest hour, a sliver of hope emerged.<br><br><strong>Commander Layla</strong> and her elite squad known as the SSS strike a series of critical blows to the mutant army. In response, the Neo-Humanoids began developing their own new artificial soldiers designed to hunt humans and use their bodies as spawning vessels. Undeterred, Layla presses forward with her assault into mutant territory hell-bent on putting a stop to their destruction and depravity once and for all!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881090/extras/4caf46b562e49204a73f8abdb26e180e.poster.avif?t=1725107943\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881090/extras/4caf46b562e49204a73f8abdb26e180e.webm?t=1725107943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881090/extras/4caf46b562e49204a73f8abdb26e180e.mp4?t=1725107943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Who knows what bodily horrors await Layla deep in the infested halls of the neo-humanoid laboratory...</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881090/extras/c307acc89bbf2c0f6ddf6057a98209e4.poster.avif?t=1725107943\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881090/extras/c307acc89bbf2c0f6ddf6057a98209e4.webm?t=1725107943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881090/extras/c307acc89bbf2c0f6ddf6057a98209e4.mp4?t=1725107943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Choose a load-out from a wide rage of machine guns, shotguns, lasers, and homing missiles, grenades and rockets...Then drop in, shoot 'em full a holes, fill em full of lead, and <strong>explode them all into a thousand pieces!</strong><br><br>Take cover around corners, use your dodge ability, and stay healthy armed and dangerous by picking up power-ups. These range from bomb ammo and new weapons, to heath kits and even <strong>a temporary infinite ammo and bomb boost!</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2>-Satisfying non-stop trigger happy run and gun game-play<br>-30 stages total including a last boss battle, 